{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/600256-starting-a-v20-skype-game","id":600256,"title":"Starting a V20 Skype Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-23T00:24:29-07:00","id":600256,"title":"Starting a V20 Skype Game","content":"Hi there y'all. I'd like to look at starting up a V20 game via Skype. It would be on Saturdays, in the evenings (Eastern time GMT-5).<br /> <br /> I don't want to hammer out <i>too</i> much in advance, but there's the basics: it'd be a Modern Nights Camarilla game. Only Gangrel, Toreador, Brujah, Ventrue, Dominate Malks, Nosferatu and Cappadocian characters allowed. No bloodlines, but Discipline swaps might be allowed (Auspex Ventrue, Greek Gangrel, etc). The other Clans, other supernaturals and other Disciplines may not function as you expect. I like to keep the setting a bit mysterious, and if the players know how <i>everything</i> works, that's quite hard. Aside from the inclusion of Cappadocians, there are some substantial changes to Blood Magic (it's all the same) and Celerity (totally reworked, as I do not allow multiple actions at all). Other house rules can be discussed.<br /> <br /> The PC's would be relatively new vampires. The metaplot will not be a significant consideration. The social structure will be far less codified. No appointed Harpies, Sheriff or Primogen. No visiting Archons. Just a Prince and the local elders. Basically, I want this game to be about your PC's, not the rest of the abstract meta-setting.<br /> <br /> So what's the plot hook? Hunters. A local YouTuber has gone moderately viral with photographs, videos and interviews revealing some very damning evidence about the Damned. How is she finding out these details? And why did the one vampire she directly identified end up disappearing a few days later? Beware <i>The Witching Minute</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT: Whups. Contact info. You can reach me on Skype (somnorianbadgermonster) or via gmail (piratezombie) or reply here. Skype IM is preferred, as I like to converse in real time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-26T21:17:16-07:00","id":604460,"title":"","content":"I've got one interested person. I need at least 3 to run, though. Anyone out there?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T16:45:09-07:00","id":611457,"title":"","content":"I have three players signed up now. The game will be scheduled for 5-9 PM EST on Saturdays. 1-2 more players wouldn't be amiss, though! Contact me via Skype or email if you're interested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013